the exact hypotheses of Borel localization once locally proved), **proved
model-conditional physics** (for example, the monopole energy bound from the
stated classical action), **formal/source-reported field-theory derivation**
(S3/S4 and instanton path-integral formulas), or **open/status-pending** (only
after the exact question and literature status are reviewed). No infinite-
dimensional continuum measure, universal localization identity, general
physical BPS count, or all-regime quiver/spectral-network claim is established
by this note.

